<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\風呂.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家風呂.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>A quiet bathroom. Rising steam.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was staring blankly at the steam rising from the tub.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had hidden the listening device away somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="2">police</STYLE> must think I might be here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\かけ湯.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The bathroom door opened, and cold air came in, trading places with the damp steam.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Along with that air, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> came in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd said she wouldn't take her eyes off me, so of course we were bathing together too.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂入る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> silently rinsed off with hot water and got into the tub.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">police officer</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> earlier was funny. He got all flustered in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">he</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s into that kind of thing?"</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "38" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
I'd meant it as a fun topic, but <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s expression didn't change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ever since she'd heard about the listening device, she'd looked even more serious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... you must think it's weird after all... Me suddenly saying stuff like I want it to be just us two, and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">police</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> coming and leaving a bug..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I don't know what you're thinking, but as long as I stay with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> the whole time, it'll be okay, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "風呂波紋.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―An unnaturally long silence passed between us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They say that between close friends, it isn't awkward even without conversation, but today was different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This silence was very heavy.<PG>
I glanced sideways at <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She didn't move, just stayed perfectly silent. As if she were counting the ripples on the water.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what are you looking at?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Nothing, really..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Talking to her was a mistake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The air after a failed try at breaking a silence is heavier than plain silence.<PG>
But to break the silence, I have no choice but to speak first.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s head is surely full of what she's hiding.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, no matter what happens, I'm on </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> side. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Even if it came to you committing a crime, I would never, ever abandon </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... don't say that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If you say that to me... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n960\r\n500\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n960\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> ducked under the water.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Meaning she couldn't let me see her face right now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's fine. For now, I'll do as <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> wishes and stay by her side.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂万歳.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ta-da! Erina Goto has arrived!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hyah!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂飛込み.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> burst into the bathroom and jumped into the tub without even rinsing off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "960" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n174\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n174\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Pwah! Sneaking off to the bath, just the two of you? Am I being left out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> flashed us a big grin.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "960" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n40\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n40\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ow, that hurt, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! What's the big idea?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> surfaced, holding her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huuuh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you were in here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> saw me get in! Talk about playing dumb!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ehh? Goto is a dummy, so she doesn't get it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why, you </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">obnoxious brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! I'll punish you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> got out of the tub and blasted <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> with cold water from the shower.
{PLAYSND "SE\蛇口.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シャワー.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "200" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Eeek, it's cooold!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n960\r\n500\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n960\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> shrieked and ducked under the water in the same instant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
The cold water was hitting me too. It was more than I could take.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I got out of the tub too.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"When </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> comes up, I'll finish her off in one go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> held the shower at the ready, waiting for <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> to run out of breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\噴射の手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "271" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\蛇口.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シャワー.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "人物2" "QUAKE" "1" "0" "5" "0" "30"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\噴射.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then just <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s hand reached up out of the water, pressed a finger over the faucet, and shot out a blast of cold water.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cold water came flying at us hard.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Th-that's dirty! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Daaamn it!"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "200" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "960" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n300\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n300\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> poked just her face out of the water.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Nahhahha! You're a hundred years too early to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="たて">defy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the genius girl, as everyone agrees, myself included!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Oh?</STYLE>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n174\r\n300\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">Huge!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Ho ho... So you look a lot slimmer in clothes than you are."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> was looking <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s whole body over, thoroughly, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="なめ">ogling</STYLE> her.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "24" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"A... are you an idiot, you </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">dirty old man</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> turned bright red and covered herself with both arms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"And </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ahh... I see, I see... Just like you look."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hey! What's that supposed to mean?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was definitely not a compliment.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you little...! Going on and on about everybody else!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what about you?! I bet </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'re just like you look too, with a little kid's body!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh? The way she put that: 'you're just like you look <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="・">too</STYLE>.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wasn't that a roundabout dig at my figure?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> stood up abruptly.
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\五島スマイル.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\五島のスタイル.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you curious about my figure?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Im... impossible...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> standing there, we couldn't say a thing back.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"H-hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Say something... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―say something to her!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Wh... whaaat!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s impossible demand threw me, but even I was starting to find <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> obnoxious.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Y-you shorty! You little runt!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh my? In certain </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="かいわい">circles</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, this size goes over better!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Did you see how </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> acted earlier? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s definitely a lolicon!"</STYLE><PG>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Achoo!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
　
